        "summary": "2-Dy shows competing ferro- and antiferromagnetic interactions and/or Dy crystal-field effects. The central Mn8O13 spin is smaller than in 1-Dy and couples antiferromagnetically to the Dy3 triads, while coupling within each Dy3 triad is ferromagnetic. It is an SMM with a lower barrier than 1-Dy; comparison with diamagnetic 2-Y indicates that the slow relaxation originates mainly from the Dy3 units.",
